## 5. Reproducing the findings

Every finding above is reproducible under `node --test` with no Foundry world,
no credential and no network. Save as `foundry-module/repro.mjs` and run
`node repro.mjs` from `foundry-module/`; delete it afterwards — it is not part
of the suite, and since `f632722` that directory is tracked, so a leftover copy
shows up as an untracked file.

